		{"id":"a2c62d6dcaac3e97","type":"text","text":"The **Dawn Age**, also known as the **Age of Dawn**, the **Time of Dragons**, or the **Time of titans**\ncame forth as the creator races disapeared\nlesser races where largely used as servants and slaves\nwere huge wars betwheen the titans and the dragons. the dragons where winning til the \n","x":-799,"y":-500,"width":463,"height":260},
