		{"id":"c394552929164f83","type":"text","text":"as the fall of [[Mystryl]] came about [[mystra]] came inn and took over the rolle the gods decided that 10th level and above spells where innacasiable by mortals making great fall for humanity in magic with this came also the limit of magic making magic require great studdy and making magic rare this ledd to a hard time but eventuly the world adjusted","x":1720,"y":-489,"width":800,"height":259},
		{"id":"a5f10af2fd2b03de","type":"text","text":"fall\n[[Karsus and the fall of magic]]\nKarsus, the greatest wizard of Netheril, created the 12th-level spell _Karsus’s Avatar_ to steal the power of Mistral, the goddess of magic, and save his empire. Instead, he shattered the Weave that sustained all magic, causing Netheril’s floating cities to fall and ending an age of wonder. Mistral sacrificed herself to restore balance, while Karsus became a cursed vestige—an eternal reminder of mortal hubris.","x":1140,"y":-440,"width":480,"height":270},
